    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Ann Marie* has been feeling anxious since the day she was first told about her late-stage cancer. Uncertainty about her health is a constant in her life and symptoms as trivial as a running nose can unnerve her. Lately, her visits to the doctor haven't been helpful either as information about her disease only makes her feel more isolated, as though no one else can relate to the daily struggle of living with cancer.",
